WEBVTT

1

00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:23.083

We die trusting the living who follow

to find meaning in our lives!



2

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:29.000

That is the sole method in which

we can rebel against this cruel world!



3

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.167

My soldiers, rage!



4

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:33.583

My soldiers, scream!



5

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:36.500

My soldiers, fight!



6

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:51.000

The commander!



7

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.833

Don't look back! Charge!



8

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:41.208

How pitiful...



9

00:02:41.208 --> 00:02:44.792

To never learn from the mistakes of history...



10

00:02:44.792 --> 00:02:49.583

It's a tragedy how King Reiss

stole their memories of the world.



11

00:02:49.583 --> 00:02:52.750

That's why they're repeating the same mistakes.



12

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.000

In the end, they'll send every

last person in the walls,



13

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.042

down to the children and

elderly, on a suicide charge.



14

00:03:00.042 --> 00:03:03.625

Saying if they're going to die,

they may as well die proud.



15

00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:05.583

It's bullshit!



16

00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:09.750

I crushed it into dust?



17

00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:13.583

What's gotten into me?



18

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:16.083

Why are you getting worked up?



19

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:18.625

You're not like your father, right?



20

00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:21.458

You've gotta try to enjoy things.



21

00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:25.958

So let's turn them all into

proud little chunks of meat!



22

00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:28.958

The second volley is coming! Fire!



23

00:03:34.875 --> 00:03:36.167

It's coming...



24

00:03:40.958 --> 00:03:42.958

Is this how I die?



25

00:03:44.792 --> 00:03:47.250

I wonder what Hitch is doing...



26

00:03:48.292 --> 00:03:51.667

Wait, I bet she's still in bed...



27

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.750

Sounds nice...



28

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.250

I don't get it... Why am I,

at a time like this...?



29

00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:12.125

Yeah!



30

00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:14.625

Game over!



31

00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:18.542

You like that? I changed how I threw the pitch.



32

00:04:18.542 --> 00:04:20.958

Now you're done for.



33

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.333

Fire!



34

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:36.833

Like I said... How is firing those

things going to help you?



35

00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:43.625

All that screaming...

What good is it going to do you?!



36

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.625

Aww, you poor things...



37

00:04:59.917 --> 00:05:01.167

Hmm?



38

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.208

What's that?



39

00:05:04.208 --> 00:05:06.667

My Titans have fallen...



40

00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:21.875

Huh?



41

00:05:21.875 --> 00:05:24.500

I need to watch out for a single soldier?



42

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:28.375

Yes. Captain Levi is dangerous.



43

00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:30.500

Is this Levi?



44

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:32.917

My nape!



45

00:05:35.333 --> 00:05:36.750

What the--?



46

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.375

I can't see a thing!



47

00:05:39.417 --> 00:05:41.250

Did he take out my eyes?



48

00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:44.083

My legs!



49

00:05:45.792 --> 00:05:49.375

What happened to all that fun you were having?!



50

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.958

Tsk! I'll harden!



51

00:05:52.958 --> 00:05:54.375

Shoot, I won't make it!



52

00:05:54.375 --> 00:05:57.083

Come on, let's try to enjoy this!



53

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:23.500

After transforming, if your

body's severely damaged,



54

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.542

it's too busy healing to let you transform.



55

00:06:26.542 --> 00:06:28.542

Isn't that right?



56

00:06:31.042 --> 00:06:33.208

Hey, answer me.



57

00:06:33.208 --> 00:06:35.333

Learn some manners.



58

00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:39.500

I can't kill him yet...



59

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.208

Isn't anyone out there still alive?



60

00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:50.000

If they are, even on the brink of death,

this injection will make them a Titan.



61

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:55.000

We can have them eat this guy

and steal the Beast Titan's power.



62

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.500

Someone, just one...



63

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.750

...I can bring back to life.



64

00:07:15.083 --> 00:07:16.375

Hey...



65

00:07:16.375 --> 00:07:18.542

Where are you going? Stop...



66

00:07:19.625 --> 00:07:23.208

All of you! Go kill him!



67

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.625

It hurts! You've done it now, Levi!



68

00:07:33.625 --> 00:07:35.542

It hurts!



69

00:07:35.542 --> 00:07:38.500

But your weapons have to be all used up.



70

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.833

With this, you'll all be wiped out!



71

00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:44.792

That might've been a close one,

but victory is ours!



72

00:07:44.792 --> 00:07:46.667

Wait...



73

00:07:46.667 --> 00:07:49.208

I made a promise to him...



74

00:07:50.167 --> 00:07:53.042

...that I'd kill you no matter what.



75

00:07:54.125 --> 00:07:55.833

I promised!



76

00:08:04.542 --> 00:08:09.458

Why... am I... alive?



77

00:08:09.458 --> 00:08:10.833

The others...



78

00:08:13.667 --> 00:08:15.625

Hey!



79

00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:18.292

Is anyone else alive?!



80

00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:25.083

That bastard...



81

00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:28.125

To think he's seriously alive...



82

00:08:28.125 --> 00:08:31.125

Why won't he just stay dead?



83

00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:35.167

What the hell do we do...

against something like that?!



84

00:08:36.625 --> 00:08:38.542

Hey, Armin...



85

00:08:38.542 --> 00:08:42.417

I think having Eren escape

is the best we can do.



86

00:08:42.417 --> 00:08:44.167

He's thinner...



87

00:08:44.167 --> 00:08:45.250

Huh?



88

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:49.500

The Colossal Titan has gotten a little skinnier.



89

00:08:50.958 --> 00:08:53.042

It's just like Hange said!



90

00:08:53.042 --> 00:08:56.542

The Colossal Titan is weak

in a battle of attrition!



91

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.750

Remember Eren's experiments!



92

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.583

He could only transform up to three times.



93

00:09:03.583 --> 00:09:09.500

If that's the case for a 15-meter Titan,

a 60-meter one might be less efficient!



94

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.708

And there's his steam attack, too!



95

00:09:11.708 --> 00:09:18.458

I bet it's consuming everything except

his skeleton to produce that steam!



96

00:09:18.458 --> 00:09:20.042

So what are you saying?



97

00:09:20.042 --> 00:09:21.667

Armin...



98

00:09:21.667 --> 00:09:23.417

I have a plan.



99

00:09:23.417 --> 00:09:25.875

You all need to draw Reiner away.



100

00:09:25.875 --> 00:09:29.000

Eren and I will defeat Bertholdt ourselves.



101

00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:34.625

The two of us can win and I'm going to prove it.



102

00:09:36.417 --> 00:09:40.542

All right. Leave Reiner to the rest of us.



103

00:09:41.667 --> 00:09:44.000

Took long enough, dummy.



104

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.625

I really thought we were goners.



105

00:09:52.417 --> 00:09:57.833

I don't know why, but when it comes

to taking back freedom...



106

00:10:00.167 --> 00:10:02.583

...strength flows through me.



107

00:10:11.333 --> 00:10:15.250

If this plan goes well, I...



108

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:17.708

...I won't get to look at the sea...



109

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:24.292

For some reason, when I think

of the outside world...



110

00:10:24.292 --> 00:10:26.750

...courage flows through me.



111

00:10:32.958 --> 00:10:34.708

Eren, wake up!



112

00:10:37.333 --> 00:10:39.417

Let's go look at the sea!



113

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:52.833

"It's said a world beyond our wildest dreams

extends outside the walls. It has fiery waters,

lands of ice, sandy snowfields, and a saltwater lake

called the sea that stretches far past the horizon."



114

00:11:04.542 --> 00:11:08.542

Eren, that sums up my plan.



115

00:11:08.542 --> 00:11:14.458

As long as we properly execute it

and manage to trick Bertholdt,



116

00:11:14.458 --> 00:11:18.250

this battle... is ours for the taking.



117

00:11:19.458 --> 00:11:24.042

Got it?! We've gotta trust that Eren

and Armin can handle Bertholdt!



118

00:11:24.042 --> 00:11:28.333

We just need to keep Reiner

away from them if we can!



119

00:11:28.333 --> 00:11:31.042

Let's keep him occupied from a safe distance!



120

00:11:31.042 --> 00:11:32.375

Roger!



121

00:11:39.625 --> 00:11:40.958

He ignored us?!



122

00:11:40.958 --> 00:11:45.125

That jerk! He's changing his focus to Eren?



123

00:11:45.125 --> 00:11:46.750

We'll just have to kill him!



124

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.000

Mikasa!



125

00:12:08.542 --> 00:12:09.500

Hey!



126

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:13.875

If we can't get Reiner's attention,

we have to finish him off right here!



127

00:12:13.875 --> 00:12:16.833

It's on us to protect Eren and Armin!



128

00:12:17.875 --> 00:12:19.708

Yeah, I know...



129

00:12:19.708 --> 00:12:21.875

We've only got three Thunder Spears left!



130

00:12:21.875 --> 00:12:23.458

Shit! But...



131

00:12:23.458 --> 00:12:25.167

We've gotta try anyway!



132

00:12:25.167 --> 00:12:28.750

'Cuz unless we fight, we can't win!



133

00:12:29.833 --> 00:12:33.625

What was that? What got me?



134

00:12:33.625 --> 00:12:36.875

A single attack took out my knee...



135

00:12:36.875 --> 00:12:40.292

I can't remember much since then...



136

00:12:40.292 --> 00:12:42.667

I'm blowing this whole area away.



137

00:12:42.667 --> 00:12:47.708

If you can, lie down with your

Titan body facing upwards.



138

00:12:47.708 --> 00:12:49.458

Bertholdt...



139

00:12:49.458 --> 00:12:52.833

What the hell happened to me?



140

00:12:52.833 --> 00:12:57.083

I don't know what's going on...

and I don't have much strength left.



141

00:12:57.083 --> 00:13:00.750

But... I know Eren's over there.



142

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:06.625

And as long as we capture Eren,

that should still mean that we win.



143

00:13:06.625 --> 00:13:08.875

Isn't that right, Bertholdt?



144

00:13:08.875 --> 00:13:14.125

I'll deal with these chumps quickly...

and come running to back you up.



145

00:13:14.125 --> 00:13:17.833

Reiner must be facing the four

who went that way.



146

00:13:17.833 --> 00:13:23.583

Strange... Only Eren and those guys

in the 104th survived the explosion?



147

00:13:24.625 --> 00:13:29.125

To be perfectly honest,

I hoped to blow everyone up.



148

00:13:29.125 --> 00:13:33.125

But I'm used to these sorts of trials, Armin...



149

00:13:33.125 --> 00:13:37.833

What's the point of waking Eren

when he's all battered like that?



150

00:13:37.833 --> 00:13:39.792

I want you to show me.



151

00:13:39.792 --> 00:13:43.542

What will you leave behind

in your final moments?



152

00:13:44.958 --> 00:13:47.792

I know it's a plan I thought up myself,



153

00:13:47.792 --> 00:13:53.125

but its success mostly depends on

how long I can hold out for.



154

00:13:54.417 --> 00:13:57.750

Armin, don't tell me you're...



155

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:02.500

Eren... Sorry, but I can't die

till I look at the sea.



156

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:06.375

So I'll have to call it quits

before it gets out of hand.



157

00:14:06.375 --> 00:14:08.167

The rest is up to you.



158

00:14:08.167 --> 00:14:12.792

Y-You know, because I'm just not a hero.



159

00:14:12.792 --> 00:14:15.792

No... You're wrong...



160

00:14:15.792 --> 00:14:18.167

The Armin I know is...



161

00:14:18.167 --> 00:14:21.042

Eren... You should know.



162

00:14:21.042 --> 00:14:24.417

We promised to go to the sea together, right?



163

00:14:24.417 --> 00:14:27.333

Have I ever lied to you in my life?



164

00:14:31.542 --> 00:14:35.792

So no matter what happens,

stick to my plan till the end!



165

00:14:50.292 --> 00:14:52.208

Sh-Shit...



166

00:14:59.958 --> 00:15:01.708

Eren!



167

00:15:01.708 --> 00:15:05.458

I knew it... This battle is already won.



168

00:15:05.458 --> 00:15:12.208

He probably has a severe concussion

and can't even stand on his own.



169

00:15:12.208 --> 00:15:14.250

Enough of this...



170

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.042

Let's end it!



171

00:15:28.917 --> 00:15:30.750

Armin...



172

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.667

All the way to the very end...



173

00:15:33.667 --> 00:15:35.583

...you fought well.



174

00:15:39.292 --> 00:15:42.833

Eren! Armin!



175

00:15:42.833 --> 00:15:45.583

No... We left it to them...



176

00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:47.708

We're going to kill Reiner.



177

00:15:47.708 --> 00:15:53.083

If there's one way to take Reiner out

with three Thunder Spears, this is it.



178

00:15:53.083 --> 00:15:56.250

We'll pick a fight with him

while he still can't move.



179

00:15:56.250 --> 00:16:01.125

Either way this fight goes,

this is where it ends.



180

00:16:02.542 --> 00:16:04.167

Bring it on.



181

00:16:09.167 --> 00:16:14.500

Reiner!



182

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.625

First, I go as the decoy.



183

00:16:18.667 --> 00:16:22.750

Conny and Sasha will follow

with two Thunder Spears...



184

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.417

...and aim for Reiner's jaw from both sides!



185

00:16:32.292 --> 00:16:33.667

Sasha!



186

00:16:33.667 --> 00:16:34.917

Jean!



187

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.833

One of them missed...



188

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:43.708

If we blow off his jaw,

Reiner's mouth should open up!



189

00:16:43.708 --> 00:16:49.667

Mikasa can use the last Thunder Spear

to hit his nape through the mouth!



190

00:16:49.667 --> 00:16:51.542

His mouth isn't open...



191

00:16:51.542 --> 00:16:54.500

Even so, I have to do it!



192

00:16:58.208 --> 00:16:59.792

Why?



193

00:16:59.792 --> 00:17:02.167

I can't blow Armin away...



194

00:17:02.167 --> 00:17:04.750

Why won't his anchor come loose?



195

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.542

He shouldn't even be able to get close!



196

00:17:08.875 --> 00:17:10.542

I knew it...



197

00:17:10.542 --> 00:17:12.917

His bones aren't being consumed!



198

00:17:12.917 --> 00:17:15.708

The anchors stay put if they're not in muscle!



199

00:17:15.708 --> 00:17:21.625

But most importantly, he can't move

his body while he's emitting steam!



200

00:17:21.625 --> 00:17:25.833

But, Armin... Is this how you go out?



201

00:17:25.833 --> 00:17:29.708

In all your wisdom, the best plan

you could come up with...



202

00:17:29.708 --> 00:17:34.250

...was to get scorched to death like this?



203

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.833

I can't breathe! I have to let go...



204

00:17:37.833 --> 00:17:40.042

No! Not yet!



205

00:17:40.042 --> 00:17:42.375

It's not enough!



206

00:17:42.375 --> 00:17:46.333

I've gotta buy more time!



207

00:17:46.333 --> 00:17:49.667

What's he trying to accomplish? A diversion?



208

00:17:49.667 --> 00:17:52.917

But Eren's still beat to a pulp over there.



209

00:17:52.917 --> 00:17:56.917

Mikasa and them have their

hands full with Reiner.



210

00:17:56.917 --> 00:17:59.417

There isn't anything else to it?



211

00:17:59.417 --> 00:18:02.750

If this really is the end for you...



212

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:06.417

All right... I'll make it quick for you.



213

00:18:10.667 --> 00:18:12.500

Hold on!



214

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.917

Don't let go!



215

00:18:14.917 --> 00:18:17.333

I entrust it to Eren!



216

00:18:17.333 --> 00:18:21.833

My dreams... My life... Everything!



217

00:18:21.833 --> 00:18:27.250

This is the one and only thing I have to give!



218

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.375

I'm sure...



219

00:18:29.375 --> 00:18:31.625

...Eren will...



220

00:18:31.625 --> 00:18:34.625

...reach... the sea...!



221

00:18:36.375 --> 00:18:37.792

He'll look at...



222

00:18:39.667 --> 00:18:41.583

...the sea for me!



223

00:18:49.042 --> 00:18:51.542

Mikasa! It's too risky!



224

00:18:51.542 --> 00:18:53.833

No, it's perfect!



225

00:19:04.375 --> 00:19:05.708

Hange!



226

00:19:07.708 --> 00:19:10.083

Now's your chance, Mikasa!



227

00:19:14.333 --> 00:19:16.458

She can't be...



228

00:19:16.458 --> 00:19:17.875

Reiner!



229

00:19:17.875 --> 00:19:19.375

Come out!



230

00:19:33.667 --> 00:19:35.250

It's over...



231

00:19:37.708 --> 00:19:41.042

Next is Eren and the horses...



232

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.667

That's...



233

00:19:49.292 --> 00:19:50.917

...hardening?



234

00:19:57.375 --> 00:19:58.875

Gotcha!



235

00:20:12.708 --> 00:20:15.125

A diversion?!



236

00:20:15.125 --> 00:20:19.208

Which means Eren tricking me

into thinking he couldn't move...



237

00:20:19.208 --> 00:20:21.417

...and all Armin's stalling...



238

00:20:21.417 --> 00:20:26.458

...was just to buy Eren enough time

to make a replica hardened Titan!



239

00:20:34.167 --> 00:20:39.833

They did it... to make me think

there weren't any enemies nearby...



240

00:20:39.833 --> 00:20:43.375

To make me... lower my guard...



241

00:21:10.292 --> 00:21:13.542

Have I ever lied to you in my life?



242

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:19.375

Dammit, I should've known...



243

00:21:23.333 --> 00:21:26.625

Hey, why don't you fight back?



244

00:21:26.625 --> 00:21:27.875

Huh?



245

00:21:30.042 --> 00:21:32.667

They pick on you 'cuz you don't hit back.



246

00:21:32.667 --> 00:21:35.083

Are you fine with losing forever?



247

00:21:37.167 --> 00:21:40.417

I'm... not losing.



248

00:21:40.417 --> 00:21:41.833

Huh?



249

00:21:43.667 --> 00:21:46.167

Because I don't run.



250

00:21:52.542 --> 00:21:54.792

Hey, what's your name?



251

00:21:54.792 --> 00:21:55.958

Huh?



252

00:22:06.292 --> 00:22:10.417

I knew... you were more of a hero...



253

00:22:12.958 --> 00:22:15.042

...than anyone else.



254

00:23:57.625 --> 00:24:01.375

Finding resolve, Eren and the

others defeat their enemies.



255

00:24:01.375 --> 00:24:05.750

However, what they lost cost

more than what they won.



256

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:09.375

The despair alone has left them stunned.



257

00:24:09.375 --> 00:24:12.096

Next episode: "Midnight Sun."

